+Please fix the following issues:
+1. In `server.js`, import and register routes for `/api/cases` and `/api/tasks`.
+2. In `public/js/app.js`, wrap all API fetch calls inside `try...catch` blocks to prevent JS execution from crashing on 404/500 errors.
+3. In `public/js/app.js` and `public/index.html`, ensure event listeners for tab switching and "Add" modal buttons are correctly attached after DOMContentLoaded.

